rgatoire R near Las Animas affecting Bent\nCounty.\n\nFor the Purgatoire River...including Purgatoire near Las Animas...\nMinor flooding is forecast.\n\n* WHAT...Minor flooding is forecast.\n\n* WHERE...Purgatoire River near Purgatoire R near Las Animas.\n\n* WHEN...From this morning to Sunday morning.\n\n* IMPACTS...At 9.0 feet, Minor Flood. Minor agricultural flooding\noccurs into low lying areas along the river.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 8:15 AM MDT Thursday the stage was 8.9 feet.\n- Forecast...The river will rise above flood stage late this\nmorning to 10.5 feet this evening. It will then fall early\ntomorrow afternoon. It will rise to 9.5 feet Saturday morning. It\nwill then fall below flood stage late Saturday evening.\n- Flood stage is 9.0 feet.\n- Flood History...This crest compares to a previous crest of 10.5\nfeet on 08/19/2004.\n- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood","ends":"2026-10-04T09:00:00-06:00","severity":"Severe","areaDesc":"Bent, CO","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.3e98b8d6f90a246f1361b950c20f3b9588e9d2a7.001.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.3e98b8d6f90a246f1361b950c20f3b9588e9d2a7.001.1"}],"afd":{"office":"PUB","issued":"2026-10-01T23:21:00+00:00","snippet":"000 FXUS65 KPUB 012321 AFDPUB Area Forecast Discussion National Weather Service Pueblo CO 521 PM MDT Thu Oct 1 2026 .KEY MESSAGES... - Potential for frost across the San Luis Valley overnight, with slowly clearing skies across the plains leading to patchy fog. - Warmer and drier weather into the weekend. - Occasional passing waves brings chances of precipitation for the middle of next week. && .SH","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=PUB&issuedby=PUB&product=AFD&format=CI"},"hwo":{"office":"PUB","issued":"2026-10-01T18:23:00+00:00","snippet":"000 FLUS45 KPUB 011823 HWOPUB Hazardous Weather Outlook National Weather Service Pueblo CO 1223 PM MDT Thu Oct 1 2026 COZ058>089-093>099-021830- Western Mosquito Range/East Lake County Above 11000 Fee